@startuml
title Distributed Lock Component - Maven Module Structure
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "distributed-lock-component" {
  folder "distributed-lock-api" as api
  folder "distributed-lock-core" as core
  folder "distributed-lock-provider" as provider {
    folder "distributed-lock-provider-redis" as redis
    folder "distributed-lock-provider-redisson" as redisson
    folder "distributed-lock-fencing-provider-jdbc" as jdbc
  }
  folder "distributed-lock-starter" as starter
  folder "distributed-lock-demo" as demo
  folder "docs" as docs
  folder "uml" as uml
}

starter --> core : assemble core beans
starter --> redis : register Redis provider
starter --> redisson : register Redisson provider
starter --> jdbc : register JDBC fencing provider
core --> api : public model
redis --> core : LockProvider SPI
redisson --> core : LockProvider SPI
jdbc --> core : FencingTokenProvider SPI
demo --> starter : use auto configuration

note right of core
SPI 目前位于 core.spi。
等 ZK/Etcd Provider 真正落地后，再评估是否拆出 distributed-lock-spi Maven Module。
end note
@enduml
